# Mirror margins (reference/components/document.md). Pages of 300 × 200 with Margin: 20 30 20 50 and Mirror margins: true:
# the odd pages have the page area of 220 × 160 from (50, 20) and the even ones, from (30, 20).
#
# Three sections, five pages:
#   first (2 pages):  a (100 high) and b (100 high) do not fit together (200 > 160): a on page 1 (odd, x = 50) and b on
#                     page 2 (even, x = 30). foot (Page overlay of the document, full width) follows the page area:
#                     (50, 168) on page 1 and (30, 168) on page 2. num-odd (Pages: odd, bottom right) only on the odd
#                     pages, at x = 50 + 220 - 30 = 240; num-even (Pages: even, bottom left) only on the even ones, at x = 30.
#   second (1 page):  Begin on: odd and page 3 is odd: no blank page. c at (50, 20); foot and num-odd as on page 1.
#   third (1 page):   Begin on: odd, and the previous one ends on page 3: page 4 is blank (nothing is dumped) and the
#                     section starts on page 5. Its Page declares Margin: 10 without Mirror margins, so it declares the
#                     margin group again, symmetric: page area of 280 × 180 from (10, 10). d at (10, 10); foot at (10, 178),
#                     280 wide; num-odd at x = 10 + 280 - 30 = 260.
Document (dev.stxt.pdf):
	Language: es
	Title: Prueba
	Page:
		Width: 300
		Height: 200
		Margin: 20 30 20 50
		Mirror margins: true
	Styles:
		For element: Document
			Typography:
				Font: IBM Plex Sans
				Size: 10
	Page overlay:
		Id: foot
		Offset: auto 0 0 0
		Box:
			Height: 12
			Background: #E3E8EE
		Text: Pie
			Typography:
				Align: center
	Page overlay:
		Id: num-odd
		Pages: odd
		Offset: auto 0 0 auto
		Box:
			Width: 30
			Height: 12
			Background: #F2C94C
		Text: {page}
			Typography:
				Align: right
	Page overlay:
		Id: num-even
		Pages: even
		Offset: auto auto 0 0
		Box:
			Width: 30
			Height: 12
			Background: #F2C94C
		Text: {page}
	Section:
		Id: first
		Block:
			Id: a
			Box:
				Height: 100
				Background: #DCEBDD
			Text: Uno
		Block:
			Id: b
			Break:
				Keep together: true
			Box:
				Height: 100
				Background: #EFE6CF
			Text: Dos
	Section:
		Id: second
		Begin on: odd
		Block:
			Id: c
			Box:
				Height: 60
				Background: #DCEBDD
			Text: Tres
	Section:
		Id: third
		Begin on: odd
		Page:
			Margin: 10
		Block:
			Id: d
			Box:
				Height: 60
				Background: #EFE6CF
			Text: Cuatro
